        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity in this first-person, 3D physics-based, puzzle-platformer to reach the end of each trial. The early trials (Tier 1 levels) are simpler with limited gravity control with later trials (Tier 2+) providing more challenge and freedom. You'll be sure to have your navigation and problem-solving skills put to the test. You can also take on a number of bonus levels such as races and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.poster.avif?t=1761652143\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.webm?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.mp4?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVIT includes a number of other gameplay features  such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freezing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects can be frozen, locking them in place so that they are no longer affected by gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Negation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tiles will prevent you from switching gravity. It's always a good idea to think twice before stepping on them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity zones allow you to change the level's gravity without affecting yourself. This can be used to open certain doors or lift platforms to new locations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powered Doors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These doors require the player to find an energy cube in order to open them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Pads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are buttons which will require the player to land on them with sufficient speed to activate. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself and extra challenge and locate the collectable orbs hidden throughout each level. As well as giving you a sense of accomplishment, a certain number is required to progress to the second more difficult tier of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available for Tier 1 levels, hard mode requires the player to navigate the levels in new ways to collect all of the energy orbs before the exit portal will spawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game with another player in local split-screen, with independent or shared gravity control. Dedicated cooperative levels are in development and will be added at a later date.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity in this first-person, 3D physics-based, puzzle-platformer to reach the end of each trial. The early trials (Tier 1 levels) are simpler with limited gravity control with later trials (Tier 2+) providing more challenge and freedom. You'll be sure to have your navigation and problem-solving skills put to the test. You can also take on a number of bonus levels such as races and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.poster.avif?t=1761652143\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.webm?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288390/extras/bdaef41016cd6b5cd3f07f7f905f0d08.mp4?t=1761652143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVIT includes a number of other gameplay features  such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freezing Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects can be frozen, locking them in place so that they are no longer affected by gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Negation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tiles will prevent you from switching gravity. It's always a good idea to think twice before stepping on them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Zones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity zones allow you to change the level's gravity without affecting yourself. This can be used to open certain doors or lift platforms to new locations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powered Doors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These doors require the player to find an energy cube in order to open them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity Pads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are buttons which will require the player to land on them with sufficient speed to activate. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collectables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself and extra challenge and locate the collectable orbs hidden throughout each level. As well as giving you a sense of accomplishment, a certain number is required to progress to the second more difficult tier of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available for Tier 1 levels, hard mode requires the player to navigate the levels in new ways to collect all of the energy orbs before the exit portal will spawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game with another player in local split-screen, with independent or shared gravity control. Dedicated cooperative levels are in development and will be added at a later date.</p>",
        "short_description": "Manipulate gravity to reach the end of each stage in this first-person, physics-based, puzzle-platformer. The game includes a variety of hand-crafted levels and increasingly difficult challenges to put your problem-solving and navigational skills to the test.",
